@startuml
title Mesh Messenger - How It Works

left to right direction

rectangle "📱 Sender" as S
rectangle "📱 Relay A" as A
rectangle "📱 Relay B" as B
rectangle "📱 Recipient" as R

S --> A : BLE / Wi-Fi Direct
A --> B : Forward
B --> R : Forward

S ..> R : No direct connection required

note bottom of S
Message encrypted
Unique ID
TTL
end note

note bottom of A
Check ID
Check TTL
Relay message
end note

note bottom of B
Store & Forward
if recipient unavailable
end note

note bottom
Infrastructure-free communication
No Internet - No SIM - No Cell Tower
end note

@enduml